  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some games support custom music and I think it'd be nice to be able to have your own tune play inside of VRChat on the loading screen. \n\nIdeas for this:\n\nMaybe make a folder inside the VRChat game folder named \"LoadingMusic\" or something of the sort\n\nUsing documents similar to how GTA games do it for example\n\n- C:\\Users\\VRCat\\Documents\\VRChat\\UserMusic \n\nPlacing it where the VRChat folder is located inside your appdata folder.\n\n(If a User has multiple tracks)\n\nThey can select them maybe inside a menu or somewhere in the audio settings named \"Loading Tunes\" or something of the sort.\n\nI think this would be a neat little quality of life feature to the game honestly.",
